### 1. Sign up
#### Request
POST {{url}}/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.admin@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!."
}

### 1.1. Sign in
#### Request
POST {{url}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.admin@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!."
}

### 1.2 Test who am i
#### Request
GET {{url}}/users/whoami
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}

### 1.3 Sign out
#### Request
POST {{url}}/auth/signout
Cookie: Authentication={{cookie}}

### 2. Find user by id
#### Request
GET {{url}}/auth/1

### 3. Find user by email
#### Request
GET {{url}}/auth?email=john.doe@gmail.com

### 4. Delete user
#### Request
DELETE {{url}}/auth/2

### 5. Update user
#### Request
PATCH {{url}}/auth/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe1@gmail.com"
}
